Now Go to System >> Preferences >> Startup Applications

Click the button: Add
Fill the empty fields with the following information: 
Name: IBus Daemon
Command: /usr/bin/ibus-daemon -d
Comment: Start IBus daemon when Gnome starts

Restart your System.

Go to System >> Preferences >> IBus Preferences
Click Input Method
Click Select an input method
Go to Bengali >> bijoyClassic (m17n),bijoyUnicode (m17n)
Then Click Add Button.
Close the window by clicking Close Button. 


To test Bijoy Keyboard go to:
Applications >> Office >> OpenOffice.org Word Processor


To active Bijoy Keyboard:
Press Ctrl+Space and then Alt+Shift
